            <ArticleTitle>Failed back syndrome secondary to previous spondylolisthesis surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>109-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The author presents a particular manifestation of the failed back syndrome secondary to previous spondylolisthesis surgery: the flat back syndrome. Surgical treatment of this condition require, in the author experience, combined anterior and posterior surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
